author: maintainer-agent
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: "Issue/Bug/Defect titled with command words update/change route to Fixed; chore 'update dependency' stays Changed; explicit feature tag still wins; regression tests added; dist rebuilt; changelog:check passes"
reviewer: steve
severity: medium
resolution: "Bug-like item types now outrank ambiguous title-only Added and Changed keywords, while explicit type/tag signals remain authoritative and non-bug title keywords retain Added/Changed behavior."
expected_result: Issues titled after CLI commands (pm update ...) classify as Fixed; chores 'update dependency' stay Changed; explicit feature tag still wins
actual_result: 372 tests pass; source coverage 100/100/100; 136 declarations documented; production audit 0 vulnerabilities; dry-run tarball valid; focused Add/New/Update/Change Issue regressions pass.
