  "2026-05-29T00:25:48.699Z",maintainer-agent,Discovered while shipping pm-cli pm-1lws which was misfiled under Changed
  "2026-08-11T22:51:18.731Z",codex,"Recurrence evidence: pm-cli item pm-q6n8sj is type Issue but its descriptive title contains the standalone word add, so pm-changelog 2026.8.9 placed it under Added. The prior fix only moved the Issue fallback ahead of weak Changed keywords; title-only Added keywords still run first. This work will separate strong type/tag Added signals from weak title signals, keep explicit feature tags authoritative, and add an executable regression."
  "2026-08-11T23:39:52.948Z",codex,"Evidence: npm run release:check completed typecheck, 136-declaration docstring gate, 372 passing tests, 100/100/100 source coverage, zero production vulnerabilities, and a valid npm dry-run tarball. The only expected failure was changelog drift while this reopened item was non-terminal; close then generator-owned regeneration resolves that state transition without hand edits."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
