learnings[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-05-29T00:25:48.699Z",maintainer-agent,Item TYPE is a stronger classification signal than ambiguous title keywords that collide with command/flag names
  "2026-08-11T23:39:53.272Z",codex,"Classification precedence must separate strong metadata signals (type and tags) from ambiguous natural-language title tokens. A bug-like type should beat title-only add/new/update/change words, while explicit feature/refactor/removal tags remain intentional overrides."
